# Reference tracks for `python -m agentsound compare` (never commit commercial audio)
references/
assets/refrences/
assets/references/

# DiffSinger voicebanks (python -m agentsound voicebanks): never committed - only the manifest; their licences
# forbid redistribution. Rendered vocal takes are a per-song cache (songs/<slug>/samples/vocals/).
assets/voices/*
!assets/voices/manifest.json
!assets/voices/README.md
songs/**/samples/vocals/
